What is Direct Fed Microbial?
Direct Fed Microbial (DFM) solutions are live probiotic cultures administered directly within feed rations or water lines to establish a beneficial gut microbiome in livestock. By fostering a balanced microbial ecosystem, DFMs improve feed conversion ratios, reduce pathogen load, and can replace or complement traditional antibiotic growth promoters. The technology relies on advanced strain selection, fermentation, and often encapsulation techniques that protect viability during high temperature pelleting and storage.
